BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 56.00 655.00 Td (This project delivers an end-to-end intelligent traffic estimation model and dynamic journey planner) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 0.200 0.255 0.333 rg 56.00 642.00 Td (powered by live and historical GPS telemetry generated by Delhi's public bus fleet \(~7,000+ DTC & DIMTS buses\).) Tj ET
