BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.012 0.412 0.631 rg 54.00 332.00 Td (1. Coordinate Bounding Box Filtering:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.278 0.333 0.412 rg 67.00 320.00 Td (Discards corrupt telemetry outside Delhi National Capital Territory: lat in [28.40, 28.90], lon in [76.80, 77.40].) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.012 0.412 0.631 rg 54.00 304.00 Td (2. Maximum Velocity Thresholding:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.278 0.333 0.412 rg 67.00 292.00 Td (Public buses in Delhi operate under 80 km/h governors. Pings with speed > 80 km/h or calculated acceleration) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.278 0.333 0.412 rg 67.00 280.00 Td (exceeding physical limits \(a > 4 m/s^2\) are filtered out as GPS chip glitches or multipath jumps.) Tj ET
BT /F2 8.5 Tf 0.012 0.412 0.631 rg 54.00 264.00 Td (3. Network Orthogonal Drift Rejection:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 0.278 0.333 0.412 rg 67.00 252.00 Td (Pings landing > 500 meters perpendicular distance away from any legal road corridor are removed as multipath noise.) Tj ET
