BT /F1 8 Tf 0.471 0.208 0.059 rg 67.00 630.00 Td (Decoupled pipeline: Data -> Cleaning -> Model -> Routing -> UI. Easily plugs into Delhi One Card or One Delhi App.) Tj ET
